{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792892278.6, "seq": 54, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "cost": 0.023245599999999998, "parents": ["Z31"], "log": {"edges": [["goal_tiles", "goals", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["Z46a", "s2"], "llm": {"in": 708, "out": 912, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 9.4, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "```python\n@gene(\"s2\", \"where to walk: altar once carrying enough gems (or endgame), else cleared groups to capture, else living non-monolith camps\")\ndef goals() -> Tiles:\n    gm = gems()\n    late = round() > 1850\n    if gm >= 30 or (gm > 0 and (late or team_gems() + gm >= 1000)):\n        acc = near(tile(-5, -5), 0)\n        for a in altars() - locked_altars():\n            acc = acc | near(a, 1)\n        if size(acc) > 0:\n            return acc\n    cap = near(tile(-5, -5), 0)\n    live = near(tile(-5, -5), 0)\n    for g in range(num_groups()):\n        if not group_respawning(g):\n            gt = group_tiles(g)\n            if group_reward(g):\n                cap = cap | gt\n            else:\n                t0 = best(gt, lambda t: 0 - t.x - t.y)\n                if valid(t0) and spawn_type(t0) == MONOLITH:\n                    continue\n                live = live | gt\n    if size(cap) > 0:\n        return cap\n    if size(live) == 0 and gm > 0:\n        acc = near(tile(-5, -5), 0)\n        for a in altars() - locked_altars():\n            acc = acc | near(a, 1)\n        return acc\n    return live\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: goals line 52: unsupported statement Continue", "birth": 38, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
