{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792892310.5, "seq": 60, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "cost": 0.0276416, "parents": ["Z41"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "progress", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["s1", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 917, "out": 1090, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 11.9, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "```python\n@gene('s1', 'value of doing this option now; recall follows the retreat state, skipped near home (walking is faster) or with an enemy close enough to cancel it')\ndef score(o: Option) -> Num:\n    if o.kind == PICK:\n        return 1\n    if o.kind == BUY:\n        return 100 if o.item == 6 else 0\n    if o.kind == RECALL:\n        if not LOW:\n            return 0\n        p = me().pos\n        if at(HF, p) <= 6:\n            return 0\n        e = nearest(ET, p)\n        if valid(e):\n            if dist(p, e) <= 3:\n                return 0\n        return 90\n    if o.kind == ATTACK:\n        if o.unit.is_champion:\n            return 80\n        return 60 if gems() == 0 else 0\n    if o.kind == CAST:\n        return cast_value(o)\n    if o.kind == TRIBUTE:\n        return 70\n    if o.kind == MOVE:\n        p = progress(o.tile)\n        return 49 + p if p > 0 else 0\n    return 0\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: score line 38: expected Tile, got Num", "birth": 42, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
